<Group view="presentation" hide-input="false" hide-output="true" inline-output="false" labelreference="L976" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal" spaceabove="10"><Font bold="true">Indistinguishable Objects and Indistinguishable Boxes</Font></Text-field>
</Input>
</Group></Presentation-Block><Presentation-Block>
<Group view="presentation" hide-input="false" hide-output="true" inline-output="false" labelreference="L977" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">As described in the text, distributing <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEibkYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy9GM1Enbm9ybWFsRic=">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEibkYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy9GM1Enbm9ybWFsRic=</Equation> indistinguishable objects into <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEia0YnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy9GM1Enbm9ybWFsRic=">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEia0YnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy9GM1Enbm9ybWFsRic=</Equation> indistinguishable boxes is identical to forming a partition of <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEibkYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy9GM1Enbm9ybWFsRic=">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEibkYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy9GM1Enbm9ybWFsRic=</Equation> into <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEia0YnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy9GM1Enbm9ybWFsRic=">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEia0YnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy9GM1Enbm9ybWFsRic=</Equation> positive integers.  A partition of <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEibkYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy9GM1Enbm9ybWFsRic=">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEibkYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy9GM1Enbm9ybWFsRic=</Equation> into <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEiakYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy9GM1Enbm9ybWFsRic=">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEiakYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy9GM1Enbm9ybWFsRic=</Equation> positive integers is a sum <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation> with <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation>.  (Note that this is the reverse order from the definition in the text.  Maple's commands for producing partitions list them in non-decreasing order, rather than in non-increasing order as is done in the text.)</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group></Presentation-Block><Presentation-Block>
<Group view="presentation" hide-input="false" hide-output="true" inline-output="false" labelreference="L978" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal" spaceabove="10">The Maple commands <Hyperlink linktarget="Help:combinat,numbpart" hyperlink="true"><Font executable="false" style="Maple Input" underline="true">numbpart</Font></Hyperlink> and <Hyperlink linktarget="Help:combinat,partition" hyperlink="true"><Font executable="false" style="Maple Input" underline="true">partition</Font></Hyperlink> are used to count and form partitions of integers.</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group></Presentation-Block><Presentation-Block>
<Group view="presentation" hide-input="false" hide-output="true" inline-output="false" labelreference="L979" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal" spaceabove="10">With one argument, a nonnegative integer <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEibkYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy9GM1Enbm9ybWFsRic=">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEibkYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy9GM1Enbm9ybWFsRic=</Equation>, <Hyperlink linktarget="Help:combinat,numbpart" hyperlink="true"><Font executable="false" style="Maple Input" underline="true">numbpart</Font></Hyperlink> returns the total number of partitions of <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEibkYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy9GM1Enbm9ybWFsRic=">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEibkYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy9GM1Enbm9ybWFsRic=</Equation> into as many as <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEibkYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy9GM1Enbm9ybWFsRic=">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEibkYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy9GM1Enbm9ybWFsRic=</Equation> boxes.  Likewise, <Hyperlink linktarget="Help:combinat,partition" hyperlink="true"><Font executable="false" style="Maple Input" underline="true">partition</Font></Hyperlink> applied to one argument returns a list containing lists representing partitions of the argument.</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group></Presentation-Block><Presentation-Block>
<Group view="presentation" hide-input="false" hide-output="true" inline-output="false" labelreference="L980" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal" spaceabove="10">For example, the statements below compute the number of partitions of <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbW5HRiQ2JFEiN0YnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdub3JtYWxGJ0Yv">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbW5HRiQ2JFEiN0YnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdub3JtYWxGJ0Yv</Equation> and lists all the partitions of 7.</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group view="code" labelreference="L981" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">numbpart(7);</Text-field>
</Input>
<Output>
<Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output">IiM6</Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
</Group>
<Group labelreference="L982" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">partition(7);</Text-field>
</Input>
<Output>
<Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output">NzE3KSIiIkYkRiRGJEYkRiRGJDcoRiRGJEYkRiRGJCIiIzcnRiRGJEYkRiZGJjcmRiRGJkYmRiY3J0YkRiRGJEYkIiIkNyZGJEYkRiZGKjclRiZGJkYqNyVGJEYqRio3JkYkRiRGJCIiJTclRiRGJkYvNyRGKkYvNyVGJEYkIiImNyRGJkYzNyRGJCIiJzcjIiIo</Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
</Group></Presentation-Block><Presentation-Block>
<Group view="presentation" hide-input="false" hide-output="true" inline-output="false" labelreference="L984" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal" spaceabove="10">Both commands also accept a second argument, which specifies the maximum integer allowed to appear in a partition.  For example, to answer the question: how many ways are there to distribute 7 indistinguishable balls in up to 7 identical boxes when each box can hold at most 4 objects, we would give 4 as the second argument to <Hyperlink linktarget="Help:combinat,numbpart" hyperlink="true"><Font executable="false" style="Maple Input" underline="true">numbpart</Font></Hyperlink>.</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group view="code" labelreference="L985" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">numbpart(7,4);</Text-field>
</Input>
<Output>
<Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output">IiM2</Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
</Group></Presentation-Block><Presentation-Block>
<Group view="presentation" hide-input="false" hide-output="true" inline-output="false" labelreference="L987" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">And to list them we give the same arguments with <Hyperlink linktarget="Help:combinat,partition" hyperlink="true"><Font executable="false" style="Maple Input" underline="true">partition</Font></Hyperlink>.</Text-field>
