<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">Example 11 asks how many ways there are to pack six copies of the same book into four boxes.  The way that <Hyperlink linktarget="Help:combinat,numbpart" hyperlink="true"><Font executable="false" style="Maple Input" underline="true">numbpart</Font></Hyperlink> and <Hyperlink linktarget="Help:combinat,partition" hyperlink="true"><Font executable="false" style="Maple Input" underline="true">partition</Font></Hyperlink> are described, with the second argument controlling the maximum value in the partition rather than the number of entries in the list, suggests that they do not answer this question.  But as it turns out, they do.</Text-field>
