<Group view="presentation" hide-input="false" hide-output="true" inline-output="false" labelreference="L1009" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">In other words, partition <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEieEYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy9GM1Enbm9ybWFsRic=">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEieEYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy9GM1Enbm9ybWFsRic=</Equation> precedes partition <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEieUYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy9GM1Enbm9ybWFsRic=">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEieUYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy9GM1Enbm9ybWFsRic=</Equation> when the first (from the right) position at which they differ contains a smaller value in <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEieEYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy9GM1Enbm9ybWFsRic=">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEieEYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy9GM1Enbm9ybWFsRic=</Equation> than in <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEieUYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy9GM1Enbm9ybWFsRic=">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEieUYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy9GM1Enbm9ybWFsRic=</Equation>.</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group></Presentation-Block><Presentation-Block>
<Group view="presentation" hide-input="false" hide-output="true" inline-output="false" labelreference="L1010" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal" spaceabove="10">For example, the partition <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation> precedes the partition <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation> because they agree in the two right-most positions, but in the third position from the right, <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation>'s entry is smaller than the third value from the right in <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation>.  This is called reverse lexicographic order.</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group></Presentation-Block><Presentation-Block>
<Group view="presentation" hide-input="false" hide-output="true" inline-output="false" labelreference="L1012" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal" spaceabove="10">The commands <Hyperlink linktarget="Help:combinat,firstpart" hyperlink="true"><Font executable="false" style="Maple Input" underline="true">firstpart</Font></Hyperlink> and <Hyperlink linktarget="Help:combinat,firstpart" hyperlink="true"><Font executable="false" style="Maple Input" underline="true">lastpart</Font></Hyperlink> accept a positive integer <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEibkYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy9GM1Enbm9ybWFsRic=">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEibkYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy9GM1Enbm9ybWFsRic=</Equation> as their only argument.  They return the partition consisting of <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEibkYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy9GM1Enbm9ybWFsRic=">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEibkYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy9GM1Enbm9ybWFsRic=</Equation> 1s and the partition <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkobWZlbmNlZEdGJDYmLUYjNiQtSSNtaUdGJDYlUSJuRicvJSdpdGFsaWNHUSV0cnVlRicvJSxtYXRodmFyaWFudEdRJ2l0YWxpY0YnL0Y4USdub3JtYWxGJ0Y6LyUlb3BlbkdRIltGJy8lJmNsb3NlR1EiXUYnRjo=">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkobWZlbmNlZEdGJDYmLUYjNiQtSSNtaUdGJDYlUSJuRicvJSdpdGFsaWNHUSV0cnVlRicvJSxtYXRodmFyaWFudEdRJ2l0YWxpY0YnL0Y4USdub3JtYWxGJ0Y6LyUlb3BlbkdRIltGJy8lJmNsb3NlR1EiXUYnRjo=</Equation>, respectively.</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group view="code" labelreference="L1013" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">firstpart(11);</Text-field>
</Input>
<Output>
<Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output">Ny0iIiJGI0YjRiNGI0YjRiNGI0YjRiNGIw==</Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
</Group>
<Group labelreference="L1014" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">lastpart(11);</Text-field>
</Input>
<Output>
<Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output">NyMiIzY=</Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
</Group></Presentation-Block><Presentation-Block>
<Group view="presentation" hide-input="false" hide-output="true" inline-output="false" labelreference="L1016" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal" spaceabove="10">The command <Hyperlink linktarget="Help:combinat,firstpart" hyperlink="true"><Font executable="false" style="Maple Input" underline="true">nextpart</Font></Hyperlink> accepts as its sole argument a partition, that is, a non-decreasing list of positive integers.  It returns the next partition in the ordering.</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group view="code" labelreference="L1017" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">nextpart([1,1,1,2,2,4]);</Text-field>
</Input>
<Output>
<Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output">NyciIiIiIiNGJEYkIiIl</Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
</Group></Presentation-Block><Presentation-Block>
<Group view="presentation" hide-input="false" hide-output="true" inline-output="false" labelreference="L1019" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">Likewise, <Hyperlink linktarget="Help:combinat,firstpart" hyperlink="true"><Font executable="false" style="Maple Input" underline="true">prevpart</Font></Hyperlink> accepts a partition and returns the previous partition in the ordering.</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group view="code" labelreference="L1020" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">prevpart(%);</Text-field>
</Input>
<Output>
<Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output">NygiIiJGI0YjIiIjRiQiIiU=</Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
</Group></Presentation-Block><Presentation-Block>
<Group view="presentation" hide-input="false" hide-output="true" inline-output="false" labelreference="L1022" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal" spaceabove="10">Using these commands, we can easily generate all partitions of a given number one at a time.  We initialize a name with the <Hyperlink linktarget="Help:combinat,firstpart" hyperlink="true"><Font executable="false" style="Maple Input" underline="true">firstpart</Font></Hyperlink> command.  Inside a while loop controlled by testing the current partition against the last partition, we update the partition using the <Hyperlink linktarget="Help:combinat,firstpart" hyperlink="true"><Font executable="false" style="Maple Input" underline="true">nextpart</Font></Hyperlink> command.</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group view="code" labelreference="L1023" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">p := firstpart(5);</Text-field>
</Input>
<Output>
<Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output" display="">NyciIiJGI0YjRiNGIw==</Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
</Group>
<Group labelreference="L1024" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">while p &lt;&gt; lastpart(5) do
  p := nextpart(p);
end do;</Text-field>
</Input>
<Output>
<Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output" display="">NyYiIiJGI0YjIiIj</Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
<Output>
<Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output" display="">NyUiIiIiIiNGJA==</Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
<Output>
<Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output" display="">NyUiIiJGIyIiJA==</Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
<Output>
<Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output" display="">NyQiIiMiIiQ=</Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
<Output>
<Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output" display="">NyQiIiIiIiU=</Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
<Output>
<Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output" display="">NyMiIiY=</Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
</Group></Presentation-Block><Presentation-Block>
<Group view="presentation" hide-input="false" hide-output="true" inline-output="false" labelreference="L1101" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal" spaceabove="10">Maple also includes the <Hyperlink linktarget="Help:combinat,randpart" hyperlink="true"><Font executable="false" style="Maple Input" underline="true">randpart</Font></Hyperlink> command for generating a random partition.  This command accepts only one argument, the integer to be partitioned.</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group view="code" labelreference="L1102" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">randpart(5);</Text-field>
</Input>
<Output>
<Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output">NyQiIiIiIiU=</Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
</Group></Presentation-Block>
</Section>
<Section collapsed="false" MultipleChoiceAnswerIndex="-1" MultipleChoiceRandomizeChoices="false" TrueFalseAnswerIndex="-1" EssayAnswerRows="5" EssayAnswerColumns="60"><Title>
<Text-field style="Heading 2" layout="Heading 2">6.6 Generating Permutations and Combinations</Text-field></Title><Presentation-Block>
<Group view="presentation" hide-input="false" hide-output="true" inline-output="false" labelreference="L1100" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">In this section, we will implement Algorithm 1 from Section 6.6 of the text for generating the next permutation in lexicographic order.  Implementing Algorithms 2 and 3 will be left as exercises for the reader.  </Text-field>
</Input>
</Group></Presentation-Block><Presentation-Block>
<Group view="presentation" hide-input="false" hide-output="true" inline-output="false" labelreference="L1112" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal" spaceabove="10"><Font bold="true">Interchange</Font></Text-field>
</Input>
</Group></Presentation-Block><Presentation-Block>
<Group view="presentation" hide-input="false" hide-output="true" inline-output="false" labelreference="L1110" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">Before implementing Algorithm 1, we will first write a procedure to interchange two elements in a list.  This will be called by the procedure for generating permutations.</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group></Presentation-Block><Presentation-Block>
<Group view="presentation" hide-input="false" hide-output="true" inline-output="false" labelreference="L1113" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal" spaceabove="10">The <Font executable="false" style="Maple Input">Interchange</Font> procedure will require three parameters: the list and two integers representing the indices to be swapped.</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group></Presentation-Block><Presentation-Block>
<Group view="presentation" hide-input="false" hide-output="true" inline-output="false" labelreference="L1114" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal" spaceabove="10">The procedure has five statements.  A copy of the list is made, since parameters cannot be assigned to.  The element in the list at the first position to be swapped is assigned to a local variable.  Then the first position is assigned to the value in the second position.  Finally, the second position is assigned to the value stored in the temporary name and the list is returned.</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group></Presentation-Block><Presentation-Block>
<Group view="presentation" hide-input="false" hide-output="true" inline-output="false" labelreference="L1115" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal" spaceabove="10">Here is the implementation and an example of applying it.</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group autoexecute="true" view="code" labelreference="L1116" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">Interchange := proc(L::list, i::integer, j::integer)
  local l, temp;
  l := L;
  temp := l[i];
  l[i] := l[j];
  l[j] := temp;
  return l;
end proc:</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group labelreference="L1117" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">Interchange([&quot;a&quot;,&quot;b&quot;,&quot;c&quot;,&quot;d&quot;,&quot;e&quot;,&quot;d&quot;],2,5);</Text-field>
</Input>
<Output>
<Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output">NyhRImE2IlEiZUYkUSJjRiRRImRGJFEiYkYkRic=</Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
</Group></Presentation-Block><Presentation-Block>
<Group view="presentation" hide-input="false" hide-output="true" inline-output="false" labelreference="L1120" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal" spaceabove="10"><Font bold="true">nextperm</Font></Text-field>
</Input>
</Group></Presentation-Block><Presentation-Block>
<Group view="presentation" hide-input="false" hide-output="true" inline-output="false" labelreference="L1103" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">The input to the procedure will be a permutation <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation> of the set <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation>.  Algorithm 1 consists of three steps: finding the largest <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEiakYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy9GM1Enbm9ybWFsRic=">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEiakYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy9GM1Enbm9ybWFsRic=</Equation> such that <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation>; finding the smallest <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUklbXN1YkdGJDYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEiYUYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy1GIzYlLUYvNiVRImtGJ0YyRjVGMkY1LyUvc3Vic2NyaXB0c2hpZnRHUSIwRicvRjZRJ25vcm1hbEYn">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUklbXN1YkdGJDYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEiYUYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy1GIzYlLUYvNiVRImtGJ0YyRjVGMkY1LyUvc3Vic2NyaXB0c2hpZnRHUSIwRicvRjZRJ25vcm1hbEYn</Equation> to the right of <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUklbXN1YkdGJDYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEiYUYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy1GIzYlLUYvNiVRImpGJ0YyRjVGMkY1LyUvc3Vic2NyaXB0c2hpZnRHUSIwRicvRjZRJ25vcm1hbEYn">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUklbXN1YkdGJDYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEiYUYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy1GIzYlLUYvNiVRImpGJ0YyRjVGMkY1LyUvc3Vic2NyaXB0c2hpZnRHUSIwRicvRjZRJ25vcm1hbEYn</Equation> and interchanging <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUklbXN1YkdGJDYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEiYUYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy1GIzYlLUYvNiVRImtGJ0YyRjVGMkY1LyUvc3Vic2NyaXB0c2hpZnRHUSIwRicvRjZRJ25vcm1hbEYn">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUklbXN1YkdGJDYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEiYUYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy1GIzYlLUYvNiVRImtGJ0YyRjVGMkY1LyUvc3Vic2NyaXB0c2hpZnRHUSIwRicvRjZRJ25vcm1hbEYn</Equation> and <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUklbXN1YkdGJDYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEiYUYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy1GIzYlLUYvNiVRImpGJ0YyRjVGMkY1LyUvc3Vic2NyaXB0c2hpZnRHUSIwRicvRjZRJ25vcm1hbEYn">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUklbXN1YkdGJDYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEiYUYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy1GIzYlLUYvNiVRImpGJ0YyRjVGMkY1LyUvc3Vic2NyaXB0c2hpZnRHUSIwRicvRjZRJ25vcm1hbEYn</Equation>; and putting the elements in positions <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation> and beyond in increasing order.</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group></Presentation-Block><Presentation-Block>
<Group view="presentation" hide-input="false" hide-output="true" inline-output="false" labelreference="L1104" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
